<title>SINGAPORE: IPC six-month net profit at S$18.8 mln.</title>
<headline>IPC six-month net profit at S$18.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		18.79 vs   5.32</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)   1.82 vs   0.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		 270.46 vs 738.43</p>
<p>    Other income	     0.23 vs   0.35</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 4.75 vs   4.46</p>
<p>    Operating profit	10.57 vs   4.79</p>
<p>    Associates		 7.16 vs  (0.12)</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.05 vs   0.1</p>
<p>    Minorities		 1.10 vs   0.74</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 11.14 vs  19.32</p>
<p>Note - Personal computer maker and telecommunications equipment distributor IPC Corp Ltd said extraordinary items came from divestments of two investments comprising minor stakes in two private companies.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
